say|KUSAKAM|So this is the edge of the canyon.
say|KUSAKAM|Ahead of me - the desert. The road I have to walk.
say|KUSAKAM|The armor is with me. Now I'm ready.
say||Kusakam starts climbing down from the canyon...
say|KUSAKAM|Step by step, I walk into the unknown.
say|KUSAKAM|But I know - this is my path.
exit|
